# Local build caches. `.goast-cache/gradle-work` is the persistent Gradle project directory the Kotlin
# compile gate reuses between runs (see test/compile-tests/runners/kotlin.ts). It holds absolute
# container paths and Gradle's own state, so it is machine-local by nature and never committed.
